Subject: [PATCH] tyn: sg-pc phone mouse and touch areas from the original
 Game.exe (0x433040, table 0x52ea58)

The phone can be used with the mouse and on touch screens as in the original's mouse mode (DAT_0052e6b0): the entries
follow the pointer, a click / tap chooses, the wheel pages and scrolls. Hit areas are the phone group (0x14) of the
original table 0x52ea58 (id, parent: 1 = relative to the phone screen at 1360,217, rectangle in screen pixels); id 0
is the whole screen ("click anywhere", wheel). The underlined words of the phone trigger get their areas from the
text as it is drawn (like 0x45b9f0; ids 48 + 20 * word as the original numbers them). Touch counts as the mouse.

Checked on MuMu (Android 15, not a real device, original English data): phone opened with Z, then by taps only:
home -> menu -> address book -> PhoneWave -> call; the call scene follows.

TYN only.

